msgid "Reports uncaught PHP exceptions and fatal errors (the class of bug that shows visitors a broken page) to Sentry. Regular warnings/notices/deprecations are not sent — this is scoped to failures that actually break a page, to stay well inside a free-tier event quota. Only active when WP_DEBUG is off, so local development never sends events."
