msgstr "Sends a push notification when the site fails to send an email, independently of the mailer that failed. Install the ntfy app on your phone, choose a long random topic name, subscribe to it in the app, then paste https://ntfy.sh/<topic> below. Only the site host, the time and a short error message are sent; no visitor data is ever sent."

